ful and physically realistic environments, Golf Pool VR is a competitive and fun game you can play solo or with friends.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- Player vs AI.\n- Two player MP competitive mode. \n- Arcade mode with 10 SP mini levels.\n- Detailed and immersive environments. Experience the solitude of the moon or the adrenaline - rush of a game or two on top of a skyscraper! (To gain access to all the 5 maps, player must purchase the full game DLC).\n- Accurate physics based gameplay mechanics.\n- 8-Ball Pool (Blackball) rules currently implemented.\n- Additional bonus game modes.\n- Binaural 3d sound system.\n\n*(feel free to join the Community Discord channel to find other players and schedule MP match with them https://discord.gg/ZGAHEuA )", "short_description": "Experience a unique game that combines the challenge of Golf with the rules of 8-ball Pool (Blackball)! Set in various beautiful and physically realistic environments, Golf Pool VR is a competitive and fun game you can play by yourself vs AI or MP with friends."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://frozen-dreams.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Frozen Dreams", "support_website_url": "https://frozen-dreams.com/contact/", "website_url": "https://frozen-dreams.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SIMULATION", "SPORTS", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", 